# The TRX64 SDK that software/trx64u builds against (U18). fetch_sdk.sh checks the tarball against this file and
# unpacks it into software/trx64u/.sdk/ (not in git). The SDK comes from TRX64U-MultiCore's branch t239.3 (their D26: we take
# it from there); their builds are in that repository's .ci/sdk/ and in their pipeline's artifacts, which expire.
# A copy of the pinned tarball is in our registry under sdk_package (TREX, generic); fetch_sdk.sh --download takes it there.
# DEV BUILD: 0.4.6 (base 3.4) from MultiCore's branch t239.3, commit 6e280710 (on their remote), not a release: what 0.4.5 had (D11's frame()
# and still_palette, D37's icap and partition, D36's audio_master, T256's canvas()), and T239.3 D48-D50: the UCI server left the base (its sources
# came over once in handover/uci/, now our uci/), the shared c64cart driver drops the cartridge's cached lines after each ram_write and image_write,
# and a library gets only read macros for the base's blocks (lib.mk DRV_BASE_READ_ONLY); D51's write-back service for libraries (api->wb, the
# operation writeback.flush); T256 D13's exit_to_machine and goto_screen; D41 L-3c (the Library waits for a folder a job fetches); and the VIC-20
# line (gateware/host.toml, the host's TOML A). The tarball's name does not carry the commit (trx64-sdk-0.4.6.tar.gz); it unpacks to
# trx64-sdk-0.4.6/, the name a 0.4.6 release unpacks to as well.
# build.sh checks the unpacked VERSION against source_commit and the hashes below, so a release unpacked over it is not
# taken for this build. The SDK ships no app image (since 0.4.0): the app is linked here from the base archive
# (pack_cor.sh), and base_archive_sha256 is the hash of its lib/libtrxbase.a as VERSION names it.
sdk_version=0.4.6
sdk_tarball=trx64-sdk-0.4.6.tar.gz
sdk_package=trx64-sdk/0.4.6-6e280710
sdk_tarball_sha256=fd3175debee74d545865e35b60f2071ee5f57e84b23bad03bdd4e8daf5701356
source_branch=t239.3
source_commit=6e280710
base_api=3.4
abi_major=3
api_headers_sha256=22fd021dcfb654a4a933010080ddc33b5c88a7ebee5cd18f4712ec76992e30b3
base_archive_sha256=65dc7f11d1bfc04204bb46278e942cee3e847a132078741cf96de289ec4f8080
# The online sub-app (MultiCore T239.3 L-3, D12: online search is a shared sub-app): online.u2a of MultiCore's t239.3 6e280710 apps/online, not inside
# the tarball (their .ci/sdk/online-6e280710.u2a, from that commit's trxapps build stage). 0.4.6's OnlineApi has two more members (loading and
# loading_for, D41 L-3c), and the base takes the table only when it has that size (netfs.cc online_api), so the 8ff28ba9 build we had before
# (970b0c2c..., rebuilt here byte for byte) gives no folder /Online on this SDK. trx64u.cor carries it in record 7 (pack_cor.sh --lib); it
# registers the operations and states online.* and its menu record brings the F3 tab Online. fetch_sdk.sh checks it against online_u2a_sha256 and puts
# it into .sdk/; a copy goes into our registry under online_package (TREX, generic; fetch_sdk.sh --download).
online_u2a=online.u2a
online_package=trx64-online/1.0-6e280710
online_u2a_sha256=061c73943c4419233138714f52c5fc16b3c7f5e266a20c305189d8e0ab820968
online_source_commit=6e280710
